Unresolved issues include the need for the proposed neutronics sweep to be executed, experimental validation of viscosity and pressure‑drop for the suggested FLiBe compositions, and systematic benchmarking of thin Be versus Pb multipliers in identical blanket geometries to resolve conflicting literature reports.

